onditions (mostly when there are too many running or hung threads) causing the MID to go down","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0635920 \"KB0635920 / PRB1170628 Autoupgrade fails to restart the MID Server successfully in certain conditions (mostly when there are too many running or hung threads","line":188},{"title":"PRB1396562 / KB0861153 MID Server Upgrade log shows error for \"The ServiceNow Platform Distribution Upgrade (xxx) service is not installed - The specified service does not exist as an installed service\", that does not break anything","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0861153 \"PRB1396562 / KB0861153 MID Server Upgrade log shows error for \\\"The ServiceNow Platform Distribution Upgrade (xxx","line":189},{"title":"PRB1422003 / KB0861154 MID Upgrade does not support changing the temp directory of the JVM (antivirus/security blocking temp folder during upgrade)","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0861154 \"PRB1422003 / KB0861154 MID Upgrade does not support changing the temp directory of the JVM (antivirus/security blocking temp folder during upgrade","line":190},{"title":"KB1002245 / PRB1449497 Null pointer exception when MID Server shuts down after Validating","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1002245 \"KB1002245 / PRB1449497 Null pointer exception when MID Server shuts down after Validating\"","line":191},{"title":"KB0999273 / PRB1538125 Mid Server fails to check that the temporary Upgrade process is running properly before shutting itself down, causing MID Server Down","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0999273 \"KB0999273 / PRB1538125 Mid Server fails to check that the temporary Upgrade process is running properly before shutting itself down, causing MID Server Down\"","line":192},{"title":"KB0749292 / PRB1314105 During the MID upgrade 2 minutes time-out for deleting old files is not enough for some customers","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0749292 \"KB0749292: PRB1314105 During the MID upgrade 2 minutes time-out for deleting old files is not enough for some customers\"","line":193},{"title":"KB0715612 / PRB1307275 MID Server auto-upgrade will fail if Windows has 'Application Experience' disabled","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0715612 \"KB0715612 / PRB1307275 MID Server auto-upgrade will fail if Windows has 'Application Experience' disabled\"","line":194},{"title":"KB0743123 / PRB1330396 MID Server start.bat fails to check if a Windows Service already exists for the installation folder before creating another service","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0743123 \"KB0743123 /PRB1330396 MID Server start.bat fails to check if a Windows Service already exists for the installation folder before creating another service\"","line":195},{"title":"KB0827747 / PRB1408516 MID Server upgrade fails leaving MID Server Down, due to Cisco AMP antivirus preventing the upgrade service deleting the Wrapper executable","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0827747 \"KB0827747 / PRB1408516 MID Server upgrade fails leaving MID Server Down, due to Cisco AMP antivirus preventing the upgrade service deleting the Wrapper executable\"","line":196},{"title":"KB0715244 / PRB1279578 MID server auto-upgrade fails while copying files from temp to agent folder on Windows even with ''Application Experience' enabled","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0715244 \"KB0715244: Known Error PRB1279578: MID server auto-upgrade fails while copying files from temp to agent folder on Windows even with ''Application Experience' enabled\"","line":197},{"title":"KB0719830 Is OpenJDK supported as the JRE for MID Servers, and which versions/patches can I use?","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0719830 \"KB0719830 Is OpenJDK supported as the JRE for MID Servers, and which versions/patches can I use?\"","line":198},{"title":"KB0750004 / PRB1320637 A MID Server upgrade that includes a new JRE version will overwrite the cacerts file","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0750004 \"KB0750004 / PRB1320637 A MID Server upgrade that includes a new JRE version will overwrite the cacerts file\"","line":199},{"title":"KB0779816 How to continue a MID Server upgrade after it has crashed in the middle of the ServiceNow Platform Distribution Upgrade service, leaving the MID Server Down and the Service not running","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0779816 \"KB0779816 How to continue a MID Server upgrade after it has crashed in the middle of the ServiceNow Platform Distribution Upgrade service, leaving the MID Server Down and the Service not running\"","line":200},{"title":"KB0858627 / PRB1419577 The MID Server Upgrade service doesn't properly detect if the MID Server has fully shut down, and so has issues with file locks when it starts deleting, potentially leaving the MID Server down","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0858627 \"KB0858627 / PRB1419577 The MID Server Upgrade service doesn't properly detect if the MID Server has fully shut down, and so has issues with file locks when it starts deleting, potentially leaving the MID Server down\"","line":201},{"title":"KB0858554 / PRB1429834 MID Server down after attempted upgrade, due to file locks caused by Dell SecureWorks Red Cloak anti-virus (mid.bat, java.exe, wrapper-windows-x86-64.exe)","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0858554 \"KB0858554 / PRB1429834 MID Server down after attempted upgrade, due to file locks caused by Dell SecureWorks Red Cloak anti-virus (mid.bat, java.exe, wrapper-windows-x86-64.exe","line":202},{"title":"PRB143735