ded and corrupt state\"","line":213},{"title":"KB0813636 / PRB1385357 MID Server can fail to install or upgrade to Orlando due to new external connectivity requirement to ocsp.entrust.net for OCSP certification revocation verification check","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0813636 \"KB0813636 / PRB1385357 MID Server can fail to install or upgrade to Orlando due to new external connectivity requirement to ocsp.entrust.net for OCSP certification revocation verification check\"","line":214},{"title":"KB0821436 / PRB1394171 Linux MID server auto-upgrade can fail even on Tanuki wrapper version 3.5.36 if MID service is not reinstalled","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0821436 \"KB0821436 / PRB1394171 Linux MID server auto-upgrade can fail even on Tanuki wrapper version 3.5.36 if MID service is not reinstalled\"","line":215},{"title":"KB0746874 / PRB1312206 Linux MID server upgrade fails, and MID Server remains Down, on upgrade to Madrid - Tanuki wrapper service shutdown as 'TERM Trapped'","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0746874 \"KB0746874 / PRB1312206 Linux MID server upgrade fails, and MID Server remains Down, on upgrade to Madrid - Tanuki wrapper service shutdown as 'TERM Trapped'\"","line":216},{"title":"KB0727033 MID Server won't start due to Root Certificate requirements - wrapper error \"The digital signature of the object did not verify\"","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0727033 \"KB0727033 MID Server won't start due to Root Certificate requirements - wrapper error \\\"The digital signature of the object did not verify\\\"\"","line":217},{"title":"KB0826461 / PRB1406629 After Upgrade to Orlando, MID Server fails to connect to Instance with \"last block incomplete in decryption\" if the proxy password is blank","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0826461 \"KB0826461 / PRB1406629 After Upgrade to Orlando, MID Server fails to connect to Instance with \\\"last block incomplete in decryption\\\" if the proxy password is blank\"","line":218},{"title":"PRB1396279 / KB0858646 File permissions enforcement removes permissions of the windows service's log on as user, when computer or domain name has lowercase letters, leaving MID Server down","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0858646 \"PRB1396279 / KB0858646 File permissions enforcement removes permissions of the windows service's log on as user, when computer or domain name has lowercase letters, leaving MID Server down\"","line":219},{"title":"PRB1435863 /  KB0861098 Mid Server DOWN due to false \"expected service name\" error, (1) if because of powershell issue the service name cannot be fetched or (2) if the 'case' of the Service Name not exactly matching between wrapper-override.conf and the running service/registry","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0861098 \"PRB1435863 /  KB0861098 Mid Server DOWN due to false \\\"expected service name\\\" error, (1","line":220},{"title":"PRB1437392 / KB0861829 Mid Server DOWN due to false \"expected service name\" error, if the checking script has a PSReadLine/PSConsoleReadLine error","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0861829 \"PRB1437392 / KB0861829 Mid Server DOWN due to false \\\"expected service name\\\" error, if the checking script has a PSReadLine/PSConsoleReadLine error\"","line":221},{"title":"PRB1447511 / KB0864241MID Server shows certificate chain errors with self-signed cert","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0864241 \"PRB1447511 / KB0864241MID Server shows certificate chain errors with self-signed cert\"","line":222},{"title":"PRB1489024 / KB0959468 In Quebec : MID Server upgrade stops if Powershell tests in Pre-upgradecheck failed and Powerconsole remains busy and the closing the session failed","target":"ht